  "question": {
    "text": "Which is correct relationship between <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mtext>p</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mtext>c</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> for following reversible reaction at <math> <mrow> <mtext>10</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>K</mtext></mrow> </math> temperature? <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub></math> in units of atm and <math> <mtext>M</mtext> </math> respectively<br />\r<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>A</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>3B</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇌</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>2AB</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> <mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
